---
/**
 * Override: the old VitePress site rendered each page's visible H1 from the
 * Markdown body (16 pages intentionally use a different H1 than their
 * <title>/frontmatter title). Starlight's default PageTitle would add a
 * second H1 from the frontmatter, so we suppress it and keep the Markdown
 * H1 as the single source. The `_top` anchor target used by Starlight's
 * skip link is preserved.
 */
// `_top` is Starlight's PAGE_TITLE_ID, targeted by the skip link.
---

<span id="_top"></span>
